(401040, 'Guitar Club at UCR', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Arts and Expression']::text[], null, 'Every two weeks', 'Follow the link below to Highlander Jam, which is our homebrewed posterboard website where you can find other UCR musicians to form bands or jam out or create connections.
We are building an army of noise makers to play DIY underground shows at UCR and archive the campus'' musical culture. Get on Highlander Jam, follow the IG, "join" the club, come to our meetings!
Sure, the Guitar Club may be the ugly duckling of UCR music clubs, but don''t forget, the ugly duckling is actually a beautiful swan...', 'We built the Highlander Jam website to connect the UCR musicians, now we''re building an army of noise makers to play DIY underground shows at UCR and archive the campus'' musical culture. Skipping the corporate energy.', 'Guitar Club (not just for guitarists) is a guerilla grassroots movement to connect ALL of UCR''s music and musicians. Non-corporate energy.
Follow the link below to Highlander Jam, which is our homebrewed posterboard website where you can find other UCR musicians to form bands or jam out or create connections.
We are building an army of noise makers to play DIY underground shows at UCR and archive the campus'' musical culture. Get on Highlander Jam, follow the IG, "join" the club, come to our meetings!
Sure, the Guitar Club may be the ugly duckling of UCR music clubs, but don''t forget, the ugly duckling is actually a beautiful swan...', null, null, 'https://www.instagram.com/guitarclubatucr?igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ%3D%3D&utm_source=qr', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/ucrguitarclub'),
(386438, 'Gujarat Student Association', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Cultural']::text[], null, 'Every two weeks', null, 'Our organization aims to create a welcoming community for both Gujarati and non-Gujarati people. We celebrate the rich Gujarati culture, learn about each other''s values, and raise awareness on campus through traditional events.', 'The purpose(s) of this organization shall be to create a community that is welcoming to both Gujarati and non-Gujarati people. Our primary objective is to celebrate the rich Gujarati culture and learn about each other''s values. As well as bringing awareness of the Gujarati culture on campus with traditional events. At UCR, we strive to create a safe and welcoming environment for everyone who wishes to be a part of our community.', 'gsa24ucr@gmail.com', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/', 'https://www.instagram.com/gsa_ucr?igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/highlanderlink'),
(99803, 'Hallyu At UCR', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Cultural']::text[], 'Thursday 8PM', 'Weekly', null, 'Hallyu at UCR''s mission is to promote the awareness and development of K-pop culture through cultural,educational, and social means. We aim to provide a social outlet for students with similar interests and to celebrate the Korean heritage.', 'To join, you can find us on Instagram under @hallyucr
and for more information and updates you can join our discord: https://discord.gg/ahty52tY5F
Welcome to HallyUCR
Intro to Hallyu
Purpose of the Organization
1. To carry out the goals mentioned in the Preamble, as well as the rest of the constitution.
2. To bring awareness towards the increasing popularity of the K-pop culture in North America, specifically the University of California, Riverside.
3. To encourage and support the students in their pursuit of cultural and social interests.
Name of Organization
The official name of this organization is Hallyu At UCR. This is a combination of “hallyu” and UCR. Hallyu is a word for the spread of the “Korean Wave” or South Korean culture. We plan to provide a space for people to make new connections and learn more about the culture.', 'hallyu.atucr@gmail.com', 'https://discord.gg/mMphBjq4s', 'https://www.instagram.com/hallyucr/', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/hallyuatucr'),
(234972, 'Hands On Health Care', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Service']::text[], 'Mondays 4:30-5:30 SSC123', 'Every two weeks', 'Hands On Health Care (HOHC) aims to connect pre-health undergraduate students at UCR with opportunities and programs for hands-on clinical experience. Through workshops, partnership with clinics, members gain insight into various healthcare careers while developing practical skills. Such activities include suturing, IV clinics, CPR, and EMT skills practice, among others. HOHC also serves as an outreach platform, keeping members informed about health programs, career opportunities, and volunteering throughout the Inland Empire. By offering real-world experience, students can explore and confirm their passion for a career in healthcare through this club.
Follow us on our social media platforms below!
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/handsonhealthcare_ucr/
TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@ucr.hohc', 'Hands On Health Care (HOHC) connects pre-health undergraduates at UCR with hands-on clinical experiences through workshops, panels, and skill-based activities. Outreach is also provided on various health programs, career opportunities, and volunteering.', 'Hands On Health Care (HOHC) aims to connect pre-health undergraduate students at UCR with opportunities and programs for hands-on clinical experience. Through workshops, partnership with clinics, members gain insight into various healthcare careers while developing practical skills. Such activities include suturing, IV clinics, CPR, and EMT skills practice, among others. HOHC also serves as an outreach platform, keeping members informed about health programs, career opportunities, and volunteering throughout the Inland Empire. By offering real-world experience, students can explore and confirm their passion for a career in healthcare through this club.
Follow us on our social media platforms below!
Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/handsonhealthcare_ucr/
TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@ucr.hohc', 'schan410@ucr.edu', 'http://linktr.ee/hohc_ucr', 'http://www.instagram.com/handsonhealthcare_ucr', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/handsonhealthcare'),
(357739, 'Happy English Corner', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Spiritual/Religious/Atheist']::text[], 'Fridays 1:55 - 3:00 PM, Saturdays 10:55 AM - 12:00 PM', 'Weekly', 'The Happy English Corner (HEC) 快乐英语角 is a club at the UCR campus that focuses primarily on students and scholars who are native Chinese speakers.
The HEC is lead by American Christians who help those originally from China to be introduced to American culture and to practice English with American partners from the community. The HEC desires to be a place for cross-cultural friendship development and sharing.
Sign up for the HEC through the HEC flyer WeChat QR codes in the photo gallery!
===========
The information is ONLY for airport pickup and communicating with you about the Happy English Corner.', 'The Happy English Corner (HEC) 快乐英语角 is a club at the UCR campus that focuses primarily on students and scholars who are native Chinese speakers. We help those originally from China to be introduced to American culture and practice English speaking.', 'The Happy English Corner (HEC) 快乐英语角 is a club at the UCR campus that focuses primarily on students and scholars who are native Chinese speakers.
The HEC is lead by American Christians who help those originally from China to be introduced to American culture and to practice English with American partners from the community. The HEC desires to be a place for cross-cultural friendship development and sharing.
Sign up for the HEC through the HEC flyer WeChat QR codes in the photo gallery!
===========
The information is ONLY for airport pickup and communicating with you about the Happy English Corner.
您的信息仅用于机场接机及英语角与你的沟通。
快乐英语角 (HEC) 将有志愿者为刚从中国新生免费提供接机服务 (从机场到UCR住处) 及安顿支持。
NOTE: We are willing to pick you up from the airport when you arrive from China.
You can fly to LAX or ONT (Ontario). ONT is much closer to UCR and much easier for you.
请使用以下方法之一把你的信息给Scot (梅强).
Please fill out the Google Form below, or give the following information to Scot 梅强 by emailing "ScotMyhrSoCal@Gmail.com" or connecting through WeChat ID "ScotMyhrMeiQiang”.
https://forms.gle/6bo9pMTEv1m1PgcE7
We are happy to help you!
-------------------------------------------------
*Name (in Pinyin)
