(423911, 'Hearts in Harmony', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Arts and Expression']::text[], null, 'Every two weeks', null, 'Hello we are Hearts in Harmony. We hope to create harmony in people’s lives through our passion for music, inspiring connection and joy throughout the community in Riverside. We plan to play our instruments and use the power of music to unite everyone.', null, null, null, null, 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/heartsinharmony'),
