(376150, 'Highlander Combat Robotics at UCR', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Academic/Professional']::text[], 'Times vary per quarter (Join Discord for times)', 'Weekly', null, 'Highlander Combat Robotics at UCR is dedicated to fostering a love for robotics and STEM fields in a community of passionate engineers, innovators, and technology enthusiasts. We strive to ignite curiosity and inspire the next generation of engineers!', 'Highlander Combat Robotics @ UC Riverside is dedicated towards fostering a love for robotics and STEM fields in a vibrant community of passionate engineers, innovators, and technology enthusiasts. Through immersive hands-on learning experiences, we strive to ignite curiosity, empower creativity, and inspire the next generation of leaders in the ever-evolving world of STEM fields.
Highlander Combat Robotics @ UC Riverside aims to offer aspiring engineers a platform to express creativity while acquiring crucial engineering and leadership skills, enhancing member interaction with professors, and preparing students for the engineering industry.
Currently, we are invested in nurturing and guiding students towards comprehending the intricacies of robotics, and teaching them how to go about creating them. In the near future, however, we hope to design, build, and program the robots in order to compete against teams from around the world.
Please Join Our Discord if you are interested in joining the organization!', 'combatroboticsatucr@gmail.com', 'https://discord.gg/z4Mvpybzyq', 'https://www.instagram.com/combatroboticsucr/', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/hcr'),
(359728, 'Highlander Consulting Group', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Academic/Professional']::text[], 'Thursday', 'Weekly', 'HCG is the premier student-run consulting group at the University of California, Riverside, committed to nurturing students'' professional growth by offering hands-on opportunities to collaborate directly with diverse businesses. Our practical approach enriches our members with invaluable experience in consulting and strategic management, empowering them to excel in the business world.', 'Highlander Consulting Group is committed to helping students develop their professional competencies, empowering them with the right opportunities to work directly with other Businesses, and giving them hands-on work experience in Business Consulting.', 'HCG is the premier student-run consulting group at the University of California, Riverside, committed to nurturing students'' professional growth by offering hands-on opportunities to collaborate directly with diverse businesses. Our practical approach enriches our members with invaluable experience in consulting and strategic management, empowering them to excel in the business world.', 'highlanderconsultingucr@gmail.com', 'https://www.highlanderconsultinggroup.org', 'https://instagram.com/ucrhcg?igshid=ODBkMDk1MTU=', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/highlanderconsultinggroup'),
(424106, 'Highlander Cubing', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Recreational']::text[], 'Tuesday, 6:30pm', 'Every two weeks', null, 'Our aim to provide a space for people to build community over the shared love of Rubik''s cubes and twisty puzzles. We give tutorials, go to competitions, and hold activities of our own.', null, null, 'https://discord.gg/d67wHYhGhk', 'https://www.instagram.com/highlander_cubing?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&igsh=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw==', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/speedcube'),
(346673, 'Highlander Duelists', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Recreational']::text[], 'Friday 6-10pm', 'Weekly', null, 'Highlander Duelists is a club that brings the "Yugioh" card game by Konami to UCR. Our main goal is to introduce new players to the game, rekindle the spirit of old-time fans, and provide a place for current players to socialize and play with others.', 'Highlander Duelists is a club that primarily brings the "Yu-Gi-Oh!" card game by Konami as well as a variety of other Trading Card Games to UCR. Our main goal is to introduce new players to the TCG scene, rekindle the spirit of old-time fans, and provide a place for players to socialize and play with others.
