If you need a ride to the ASG practices, we have a shuttling sheet for the Monday-Thursday practices found on our Instagram and Discord.', 'The Wrestling Club at UCR administers a competitive level wrestling environment for students to cultivate their technical and physical skills. We provide students with the opportunity to meetup with other wrestlers and gain life long values.', 'Welcome to the Wrestling Club at UCR!
We administer a competitive level wrestling environment for students to cultivate their technical and physical skills. We provide students with the opportunity to meetup with other wrestlers and learn life long values regarding hardwork, resilience, teamwork and accountability.
