If you need a ride to the ASG practices, we have a shuttling sheet for the Monday-Thursday practices found on our Instagram and Discord.', 'wrestlingatucr@gmail.com', null, 'https://www.instagram.com/ucrwrestlingclub/', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/wrestlingclub'),
(70985, 'Wushu at UCR', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Recreational']::text[], 'Sundays 5-7 PM and Wednesdays 4-6 PM, weeks 1-10 of Fall-Spring quarters', 'Twice a week', 'The purpose of Wushu at the University of California, Riverside is to foster the education of Wushu, a Chinese martial art, and to provide a productive environment where members can learn, practice, and prepare to compete. The club will also serve to promote athleticism and sportsmanship within UCR and the wider Riverside community through collaboration with other campus organizations and the performance of martial arts demonstrations.
WUCR usually meets on Wednesdays from 4-6 PM & Sundays from 5-7 PM at the UCR STUDENT RECREATIONAL CENTER in MPR B.
Join our discord! This is where we post information about all our practices and events! https://discord.gg/MrwmqwWAQW', 'The purpose of Wushu at UCR (WUCR) is to foster the education of Chinese martial arts and to provide a productive environment where members can learn and practice these arts.', 'The purpose of Wushu at the University of California, Riverside is to foster the education of Wushu, a Chinese martial art, and to provide a productive environment where members can learn, practice, and prepare to compete. The club will also serve to promote athleticism and sportsmanship within UCR and the wider Riverside community through collaboration with other campus organizations and the performance of martial arts demonstrations.
WUCR usually meets on Wednesdays from 4-6 PM & Sundays from 5-7 PM at the UCR STUDENT RECREATIONAL CENTER in MPR B.
Join our discord! This is where we post information about all our practices and events! https://discord.gg/MrwmqwWAQW', 'wushu.ucriverside@gmail.com', null, 'https://www.instagram.com/wushuatucr/', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/wucr'),
(283459, 'Young Democratic Socialists of America at UC Riverside', 'Registered Student Organization', array['Action & Awareness']::text[], 'Thursdays from 5 pm- 6 pm @SSC 112 during Week 1-2, and @SSC 125 Week 3-10', 'Weekly', 'Hang out and get to know some like-minded people
Then consider joining us for our general meetings! During the fall quarter, we''ll be meeting every Thursday from 5pm to 6pm, with some other events throughout the quarter as well. Feel free to invite your friends as our meetings are open to everyone.
Fall Quarter Weekly Meeting Location: Week 1-2: SSC112 ; Week 3-10:SSC125
Please join our discord and follow us on Instagram.
YDSA at UCR Discord
YDSA at UCR Instagram', 'YDSA is the youth and student section of the Democratic Socialists of America. We believe that working people should run both the economy and society democratically to meet human needs, not to make profits for a few.', 'Hi there! The Young Democratic Socialists of America (YDSA) at UCR are looking to make a change on campus for the betterment of our fellow UCR students as well as the Inland Empire as a whole. As part of the ''UC of the working class'' and a YDSA chapter, we advocate and fight for:
Medicare for All, Universal Childcare and Pre-K, Religious, Gender, and Racial Equality, and Working Class Solidarity
That said, if you''re looking to:
Get involved in organizing and unionizing student workers
Learn about progressive ideas that could benefit all working class citizens
Hang out and get to know some like-minded people
Then consider joining us for our general meetings! During the fall quarter, we''ll be meeting every Thursday from 5pm to 6pm, with some other events throughout the quarter as well. Feel free to invite your friends as our meetings are open to everyone.
Fall Quarter Weekly Meeting Location: Week 1-2: SSC112 ; Week 3-10:SSC125
Please join our discord and follow us on Instagram.
YDSA at UCR Discord
YDSA at UCR Instagram', 'ucr.ydsa@gmail.com', 'https://y.dsausa.org/', 'https://www.instagram.com/ydsaucr/', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/ydsa'),
(382821, 'Zeta Phi Beta Sorority Incorporated', 'Fraternities and Sororities', array['Fraternity/Sorority']::text[], 'sundays 1:30 pm', 'Every two weeks', null, 'Zeta Phi Beta was founded on the campus of Howard University on January 16, 1920. The Sorority''s international programs such as Z-HOPE (Zetas Helping Other People Excel) through Mind, Body and Spirit serve to empower people from all walks of life.', 'Zeta Phi Beta Sorority is committed to establishing and maintaining high standards in both academics and ethics in order to promote the ideals of scholarship, service, sisterhood, and finer womanhood. Our goal is to enhance the societal standing of women by addressing and overcoming the challenges they encounter, nurturing a sense of camaraderie and solidarity among college women, actively engaging in and contributing to the collegiate experience, and delivering dedicated service to the broader community. These values, which represent our dedication to quality, unity, support, and the epitome of refined womanhood, act as our cornerstones.', 'zphib.epsilonsigma@gmail.com', 'http://zphib1920.org', 'https://www.instagram.com/epsilonsigmazetas/', 'https://highlanderlink.ucr.edu/organization/zphib1920');
